stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td
(FIBRE ROUTER QUICK GUIDE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The lights on the front of the router) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POWER, green: the router is on.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PON, green and steady: the router is synchronised with the fibre network. PON) Tj T*
(blinking: the router is trying to synchronise. Wait two minutes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(LOS, red: loss of signal. The router receives no light from the fibre. Check) Tj T*
(that the green fibre cable is plugged in and not bent. If LOS stays red, call) Tj T*
(technical support: the fault is in the line, not in your home.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(INTERNET, green: the router has an internet connection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WI-FI, off: normal in bridge mode, when another router or a mesh system makes) Tj T*
(the wifi.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
