7 0 obj
<< /Length 786 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td
(Restarting the router) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When the internet drops, restart the fibre router first. Switch it off, wait 30) Tj T*
(seconds and switch it on. Wait until PON and INTERNET are steady green, which) Tj T*
(takes about two minutes. Only then restart your own router or the main node of) Tj T*
(your mesh system.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Factory reset) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(With the router on, hold the RESET pin at the back for 10 seconds with a paper) Tj T*
(clip, until all the lights blink. The router starts again with the settings of) Tj T*
(the label on its base: the wifi name, the wifi password and the admin password.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A factory reset removes bridge mode. Set bridge mode again in the admin page, in) Tj T*
(Advanced, WAN, Mode.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
